**Profile**: Title: Desorock Highland, Origin: Huanglong.

{{Location Tabs|Map:Desorock Highland}}

Desorock Highland, once a fertile river valley, was the source of many streams that nourished the lands downstream. After the onset of the Waveworn Phenomenon, abnormal weather patterns drained most of these water sources, leaving the lake area dry and giving rise to Tacet Fields and TDs.
'''Desorock Highland''' is a region in [[Huanglong]]. The region is in northwestern Jinzhou and borders the [[Central Plains]] and [[Norfall Barrens]]. The area features a frontline where many battles against TDs were fought, and there are multiple military bases and exile camps in the region. 

